OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FMostly dry with variable
OL,6,Famounts of cloud and generally light
OL,7,Fwinds. Isolated showers may develop
OL,8,Finto the afternoon, perhaps thundery.
OL,9,FFeeling very warm once again but
OL,10,Fturning cooler from the north later in
OL,11,Fthe evening.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FGenerally dry overnight with
OL,14,Fclear periods and patchy amounts of
OL,15,Fcloud. A cooler feeling night than
OL,16,Frecently, with winds remaining mainly
OL,17,Flight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
